  {
   "id": "sch_bor",
   "title": {
    "en": "Movement schedule: Borrowings (LS-BORNC)",
    "ar": "جدول الحركة: Borrowings (LS-BORNC)"
   },
   "fields": [
    {
     "id": "sch_bor",
     "label": {
      "en": "Borrowings movement schedule",
      "ar": "جدول حركة Borrowings"
     },
     "type": "table",
     "required": false,
     "columns": [
      {
       "id": "component",
       "label": {
        "en": "Component",
        "ar": "المكوّن"
       },
       "type": "select",
       "required": true,
       "options": [
        {
         "value": "principal",
         "label": {
          "en": "Principal",
          "ar": "أصل القرض"
         }
        },
        {
         "value": "accrued_interest",
         "label": {
          "en": "Accrued interest",
          "ar": "الفوائد المستحقة"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "id": "opening",
       "label": {
        "en": "Opening balance",
        "ar": "الرصيد الافتتاحي"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": true
      },
      {
       "id": "additions",
       "label": {
        "en": "Drawdowns",
        "ar": "السحوبات"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "disposals",
       "label": {
        "en": "Repayments",
        "ar": "السداد"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "transfers",
       "label": {
        "en": "Transfers and reclassifications",
        "ar": "التحويلات وإعادة التبويب"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "revaluation",
       "label": {
        "en": "Exchange differences",
        "ar": "فروق العملة"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "other",
       "label": {
        "en": "Interest, fees and other",
        "ar": "الفوائد والرسوم وأخرى"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "closing",
       "label": {
        "en": "Closing balance",
        "ar": "الرصيد الختامي"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bor_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BOR.difference",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bor_agrees",
     "label": {
      "en": "Schedule agrees to the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "text",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BOR.agrees",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bor_opening_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the opening total and the prior period",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BOR.opening_difference",
     "readonly": true
    }
   ],
   "note": {
    "en": "Principal and accrued interest reconciled from the opening to the closing balance, the reconciliation of liabilities arising from financing activities. Required by IAS 7.44A. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Borrowings (non-current) (LS-BORNC) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.",
    "ar": "يشترطه IAS 7.44A. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Borrowings (non-current) (LS-BORNC) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق."
   }
  }
